%%SelfTest: mod-pod-and-braces-beside
%   % issue #439: amsmath's \\mod and \\pod, and \\nolimits on a brace
%   /mkt-m { << /Size 100 /Irregular 0 >> mkmetrics } def
%   (a \\mod{n}) mkt-m /Width get (a \\quad \\text{mod}\\,\\,n) mkt-m /Width get
